      "text": {
        "text": "*October in review* 🍽️\nTogether you put *24 meals* on the table.\n*Cuisines:* Indian, Mexican, Thai (new to you: Thai)\n*New in the catalog:* 3 (Pad Thai, Pho &lt;Saigon&gt;, and Tikka Masala)",
        "type": "mrkdwn"
      },
      "type": "section"
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "text": "*Thank you*\nEvery meal takes a team, and everyone here is part of it.\n• *Cooked:* Alex and Sam\n• *Picked up:* Kim\n• *Ordered:* Sam\n• *Coordinated:* Alex\nAnd thank you to everyone who answered a call or pulled up a chair.",
        "type": "mrkdwn"
      },
      "type": "section"
    },
    {
